  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0: Breaking — Model types moved into nested namespaces (Layouts, Timetables, Schedules, Notes, Settings); consuming code must update its using directives. StationCall stop detection is now via IsStop; TrainPart is abstract. Added vehicle-schedule (turnus) building, cargo-flow planning, localised call notes, and structured layout settings. XPLN import gains XplnImportOptions for per-import language/country. See RELEASENOTES.md for details.",
